s tangible growth in new sectors with clear profitability.  Learning from past biases where optimism overlooked emerging vulnerabilities, I now place greater emphasis on macro trends, market saturation evidence, and financial robustness when making decisions. This disciplined approach aims to avoid overconfidence in brand strength alone and instead focuses on robust, evidence-based risk management.
