macro risks this time. I will also incorporate more conservative entry points and use hedging strategies to protect gains.  In summary, based on the most convincing and evidence-backed points from the bear side, I recommend you adopt a cautious, risk-averse approach—consider selling or reducing your position in Apple until clearer signs of sustained growth and valuation rationality emerge.
